  "composition": [
    "Fresh raw namespace, push-only unlocking and clean final stack bind 42 definitions, 360 static invocations and the exact ten-integer ABI.",
    "All canonical Fr/Fp guards, finite-versus-infinity predicates, strict G1 callees, finite B curve equations and finite B endpoint/psi operands are bound to actual input words.",
    "The full 255-bit [r]P G1 loop has exact canonical/curve guards, four symbolic accumulator paths, true callee operands, backedge and final Z=0 check.",
    "The current MSM block is exactly the old proved 256-instruction block after static callee-ID substitution; actual entry words, normalization, key table and all canonical Fr tuples transfer.",
    "All 16 finite/infinity combinations for A,B,C and computed vk_x preserve exact coefficient-indexed pairing tuples and exact Fp12 unit literals. Finite B remains subgroup-checked on the fixed alpha fallback when A=O.",
    "All three actual pairing products and the outer conjugation consume the exact preceding twelve-word tuples; the 55-slot handoff preserves 43 lower carriers and the actual top twelve-word result.",
    "The current 65-call FinalExp expression DAG, all operands/outputs, twelve terminal predicates and final stack exactly match the prior proved artifact under helper renaming. Retained carriers cannot reach arithmetic.",
    "The old field/tower/Jacobian/Miller/strict-G2/nonzero/easy/cyclotomic/hard-exponent theorems transfer through 41 exact helper fingerprints; the changed G1 body has a new independent proof. Omitted neutral factors are the field unit.",
    "The resulting unit predicate has the standard final-exponent kernel because its exponent is three times the standard exponent and gcd(3,r)=1."
  ],
  "modelPremises": [
